. Anyone after 3:00 p.m will need to come back the following buisness day. No appointment is required\nPassport Fees: Fees are seperate, you will need 2 forms of payment, cash, check or money order.\nFirst-time Adult Passport Book : $130.00 with a $35.00 acceptance fee\nFirst-time Adult Passport Card: $30.00 with a $35.00 acceptance fee\nFirst-time Adult Passport Book & Card: 160.00 with a $35.00 acceptance fee\nMinor Passport Book: $100.00 with a $35.00 acceptance fee\nMinor Passport Card: $15.00 with a $35.00 acceptance fee\nMinor Passport Book & Card: $115.00 with a $35.00 acceptance fee\nOptional Fees: Paid to the U.S Department of State\nExpidite Fee: $60.00 (Paid per application, in addition to the required fees)\n1-2 Day Delivery back to you: $22.05\nFile Search: $150.00\nProcessing Times:\nRoutine Services: 4 to 6 Weeks\nExpedited Services: 2 to 3 Weeks\nExpedited at Agency (Agency is located in Minneapolis: Limited appointments): Must have international travel with-in 72 hours (3 business days)\nQuestion's regarding international travel?\nNot finding what you need? Click here for more passport information.\nApplications\nApplication for a us passport DS-11\nRenewal Application DS-82\nReport your Passport Lost or Stolen DS-64\nData Corrections, Some Name, and Limited-Validity Application DS-5504\nStatement of Consent for Issuing a Passport to a Child DS-3053\nStatement of Special Family Circumstances DS-5525\nStatement You Did Not Receive Your U.S. Passport DS-86\nCheck passport status\nShare this page\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.mahnomencounty.gov/department/departments_a_h/auditor/passport_services.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nReddit\nClose\nContact Us\nFacebook\nMeetings & Minutes\nTaxpayer Services\nEmployment\n311 N Main P.O. Box 379 Mahnomen, MN 56557\nPowered by revize. , the Government Website Experts\nLogin\nOriginal text\nRate